  "body": "* 4 bedrooms, 3 bathrooms and a double garage\r\n* 184 sqm floor area on a 378 sqm section\r\n* Contemporary design with striking exterior detailing\r\n* Light-filled interiors with warm timber flooring\r\n* Open-plan kitchen, dining and living area\r\n* Modern kitchen with a central island and generous bench space\r\n* Walk-in wardrobe and practical storage\r\n* Stamford Building Warranty\r\n\r\nDefined by clean architectural lines, warm timber accents and a striking exterior, this contemporary Orewa home brings together modern style and everyday comfort.\r\n\r\nStep inside to discover light-filled interiors complemented by warm timber flooring, creating a welcoming atmosphere throughout. The open-plan kitchen, dining and living area forms the heart of the home, with a modern kitchen featuring sleek cabinetry, generous bench space and a central island - ideal for everyday family life and entertaining.\r\n\r\nFour bedrooms provide flexibility for families, guests or working from home, while three bathrooms offer added convenience. A walk-in wardrobe and practical storage further enhance the home's functionality, complemented by a double garage for secure parking and additional storage.\r\n\r\nSet on a 378 sqm section with 184 sqm of floor area, this home offers a thoughtful balance of contemporary design and practical living. With Orewa's local amenities, schools and coastal attractions within reach, it presents an appealing opportunity to enjoy life on the Hibiscus Coast.\r\n\r\nModern in design, welcoming in feel and ready to be enjoyed.\r\n\r\nContact Team Vinson & Amy on 022 571 7074 to arrange your private viewing or visit one of our upcoming open homes. Learn more at www.vinsonamyandco.nz",
